<body>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0"><img src="../_svg/composite_shape.svg" alt="" style="max-width:95%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)"></div>

<div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小四 · 第 13 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">複合圖形Area</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">L形 · T形 · 分割法 · 65 min · 1-on-3 Online Lesson</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》4下A冊 單元七（續）<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高頻</span> 複合圖形係呈分試幾何壓軸題常見題型<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>L11 Area入門 · L12 Square/RectangleArea公式<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 用分割法求複合圖形Area ❷ 用填補法求Area ❸ 分辨L形/T形/凸形 ❹ 正確標註各部分尺寸<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 T37 分割後漏計某部分 · T38 重疊部分雙重計算 · T39 尺寸標錯
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">📐 幾何探險家</div><div class="lf-game-desc">計算面積&體積，小心公式陷阱！三角形要除2、梯形上下底唔好調轉！</div><div class="lf-game-action">🔍 開始探險 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>Rectangle長 10 cm，闊 6 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>Square邊長 8 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>兩個Rectangle：A長6cm闊4cm，B長5cm闊3cm。兩個總Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>下面「L形」可以切成幾個Rectangle？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>一個大Rectangle（10cm×8cm）中間挖去一個小Rectangle（4cm×3cm）。剩下Area = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：分割法（切割法）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>核心思路：</b>將複合圖形<b>切成幾個簡單圖形</b>（Rectangle/Square）→ 分別求Area → 相加<br/>
      ② <b>分割要訣：</b>沿虛線切成幾塊，確保每塊都是Rectangle或Square<br/>
      ③ <b>標尺寸：</b>每切一塊，必須標出該塊的長和闊（可能要用Subtraction求出！）<br/>
      ④ <b>L形 = 兩個Rectangle拼成。</b>T形 = 兩個Rectangle拼成。
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：填補法 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🟡 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>核心思路：</b>用大RectangleArea − 挖去的部分<br/>
      ② 適合有「洞」或「缺口」的圖形<br/>
      ③ <b>步驟：</b>想像完整大Rectangle → 計大Area → 減去挖去部分的Area<br/>
      ④ <b>分割法 vs 填補法：</b>邊個簡單用邊個！一題可以有兩種解法
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">求下面L形的Area（分割法）：
    <svg height="150" viewbox="0 0 300 150" width="300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="110" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="100" x="20" y="15"></rect>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="70">A: 10cm x 11cm</text>
<rect fill="#DCFCE7" height="60" stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="2.5" width="150" x="120" y="65"></rect>
<text fill="#166534" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="195" y="95">B: 15cm x 6cm</text>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-dasharray="5,2" stroke-width="1" x1="120" x2="120" y1="15" y2="125"></line>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" x="175" y="142">總Area = A + B = 110 + 90 = 200 cm²</text>
</svg>
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">求下面T形的Area：
    <svg height="140" viewbox="0 0 280 140" width="280" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="35" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="200" x="40" y="15"></rect>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="140" y="37">A: 20cm x 3.5cm</text>
<rect fill="#DCFCE7" height="60" stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="2.5" width="50" x="115" y="50"></rect>
<text fill="#166534" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="140" y="85">B: 5cm x 6cm</text>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" x="140" y="128">(圖中數字為示意，實際Question會標註尺寸)</text>
</svg>
</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 最致命Trap：分割後漏咗用Subtraction求未知尺寸！例：L形豎直部分長11cm，總長16cm → 橫向部分長 = 16-11 = 5cm。呢步漏咗 = 全題錯！</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 重疊Trap：分割時兩塊有冇重疊？要確保切線清晰，每塊獨立、唔重疊。</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（All Must Complete，共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>L形由兩個Rectangle組成：A：長8cm闊3cm，B：長5cm闊4cm。總Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>下面L形，用分割法求Area（所有尺寸單位：cm）：
      <svg height="120" viewbox="0 0 180 120" width="180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="90" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="50" x="15" y="10"></rect><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" x="40" y="55">6x9</text>
<rect fill="#DCFCE7" height="45" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="90" x="65" y="55"></rect><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" x="110" y="80">9x4.5</text>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-size="9" x="100" y="118">(cm²? 提示：上面54 + 下面40.5)</text>
</svg></td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>T形：上面橫條10cm×3cm，下面豎條4cm×6cm。總Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（🚶🚀 Optional，共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>求下面L形的Area。尺寸標在圖上（cm）：
      <svg height="140" viewbox="0 0 240 140" width="240" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="100" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="60" x="20" y="10"></rect><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" x="50" y="60">6</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" x="8" y="60">10</text>
<rect fill="#DCFCE7" height="50" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="120" x="80" y="60"></rect><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" x="140" y="85">12</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" x="205" y="85">5</text>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="140" y="130">A=6x10=? B=12x5=? Total=?</text>
</svg></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>一個大Rectangle（12cm×10cm），左上角切去一個4cm×3cm的小Rectangle。剩下Area = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>「凸」字形：下半部8cm×5cm，上半部4cm×4cm。用分割法求總Area。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（🚀 Optional，共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>求下面開洞圖形的Area（大Rectangle10cm×8cm，中間開一個4cm×4cm的Square洞）：
      <svg height="120" viewbox="0 0 150 120" width="150" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="80" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="120" x="15" y="10"></rect>
<rect fill="white" height="40" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="2" width="40" x="55" y="30"></rect>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="75" y="52">挖走</text>
</svg></td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>「十」字形：橫條20cm×4cm，豎條4cm×16cm。（重疊部分4cm×4cm要小心唔好計兩次！）總Area = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>一個複雜L形：豎直部分12cm×4cm，底部橫向部分10cm×5cm，但豎直部分的底部和橫向部分重疊了5cm×4cm。問：實際總Area = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🏔️ 終極挑戰（🚀 Optional，共 1 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>一張Rectangle紙（20cm×15cm），四個角各剪去一個邊長3cm的Square。剩下的「八角形」Area = ？Perimeter = ？（提示：Perimeter冇變！）</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">四、Word Problems （12 min）（SSPA 文字題）</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例3</div><div class="lf-ex-q">一個L形花園，由兩個Rectangle組成：一個8m×5m，另一個6m×4m。花園總Area = ？m²。</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>一個L形客廳，RectangleA=6m×4m，RectangleB=5m×3m。總Area=？要鋪地氈（每平方米$80），總費用=？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>一個「回」字形水池：外圍大Rectangle12m×10m，內圍小Rectangle8m×6m。水池部分（邊框）的Area = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>牆壁長10m高3m。中間有兩扇窗（每扇2m×1.5m）。要油漆的Area = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>一個Rectangle花園15m×10m。園內有一條1m闊的直路橫跨整個花園。花園剩餘的種植Area = ？（兩條路？Question只講一條）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>用分割法和填補法分別計算：L形地皮，豎直10m×4m，橫向8m×5m。兩種方法答案一致嗎？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
